    <briefdescription>
<para>An indexed value bound to static functions. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A read-only value will not have a setter; a write-only value will not have a getter. An indexed value is useful for binding one of a list of possible values (such as multiple engines for a plane). The index is hard-coded at creation time.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classSGRawValue" kindref="compound">SGRawValue</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
